{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "2DYL5WIIN6QSP3X7RRQ54DRP6GVFSSUL",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041118002",
    "title": "私に愛など必要ない",
    "enTitle": "I Have No Need of Affection",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（――……？\nあれって……URAのドキュメンタリー？）",
            "enText": "(…? Is that… a documentary about the URA?)",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 225,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 216,
                    "pathId": -1838173497294991779
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 200,
                    "pathId": 5474250508794114652
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7695253399285086851,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "番組のナレーション",
            "enName": "TV Program Narrator",
            "jpText": "『――こうして彼女の幼い頃からの夢をかけた挑戦は、今年も\n涙の結果となった。取材班は、レース後の控室で話を聞いた……』",
            "enText": "<i>…this year, her attempt at realizing her childhood dream \nended in tears once again. Reporters flocked to the press \narea for comments after the race…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 359,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 370,
                    "pathId": -8694220663781463618
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 370,
                    "pathId": 5602249052308998864
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7859434837393194579,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "取材班",
            "enName": "Reporters",
            "jpText": "『――今回のレースを終えて……。\nお父さん、お母さん、いかがでしたか？』",
            "enText": "<i>…here with her parents. Well, the race has been run and \nthe results are set… how are you both feeling right now?</i>",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 155,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 370,
                    "pathId": 4547126993309515687
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 370,
                    "pathId": 2310258293274351726
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4381693287940332579,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ウマ娘の父親",
            "enName": "Horsegirl's Father",
            "jpText": "『小さい頃から、ずっと見てきましたから。私も大きなレースで\nキラキラするんだって……。負けても輝いてたよな、うちの娘は！』",
            "enText": "<i>We've always supported her ambitions. She talked about wanting \nto shine in the big races since she was a little girl… and I think \nshe always has, no matter the circumstance! I'm proud of her!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 342,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 370,
                    "pathId": 8843119848049990963
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 370,
                    "pathId": 5720189166951145458
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 132,
                    "pathId": -311679159448047787
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1888129698843098114,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ウマ娘の母親",
            "enName": "Horsegirl's Mom",
            "jpText": "『かっこいいところを見せるんだって……親想いの愛情深い子に\n育って……！　でも親としては楽しく走ってくれればいいんです』",
            "enText": "<i>She always wanted to show us her best side… It makes \nme so happy to see the loving daughter she's grown into. \nFor me it was enough to just see her run as she wanted…!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 345,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 192,
                    "pathId": -2418077140911042561
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 183,
                    "pathId": 1954901756483448962
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 356,
                    "pathId": -8969808751192680991
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9044670347258656839,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "重賞で敗れたウマ娘",
            "enName": "Gran Prix-Losing Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "『う……うぅ……ありがとう……お父さん、お母さん……！\nあたし、これからも頑張るから……！』",
            "enText": "…<i>…Mom… Dad…! Thank you… \nI'll keep trying my best…!</i>",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 305,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 370,
                    "pathId": 4951576634960396271
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 24,
                    "pathId": -8638215699369131624
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 316,
                    "pathId": -6079202229420226602
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1878476181085860015,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "番組のナレーション",
            "enName": "TV Program Narrator",
            "jpText": "『両親の言葉が、彼女の悔し涙を笑顔へ変えていく。\n未来のGⅠ勝利は、親子の愛がもたらすのかもしれない――』",
            "enText": "<i>Her tear-stained face lights up at her parents' loving words. \nPerhaps this love will yet carry her to a G1 win in the future…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 327,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": 6855499139334083150
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 338,
                    "pathId": -4425270963889733851
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8671950315763921852,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……くだらない。",
            "enText": "…Preposterous.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 68,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": -8488742866390905305
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6573609103389775240,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "施設の職員",
            "enName": "Orphanage Worker",
            "jpText": "『学校で使うものは児童養護施設のほうで全部用意してあるけれど、\n他に欲しいものがあれば、言ってね。ここは貴方のお家なんだから』",
            "enText": "We try to provide everything you would find at school here, \nbut if there's anything else you want, you can tell us, okay? \nThis is your home, after all.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 306,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -103374439465934433,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いアルヴ",
            "enName": "Young Arve",
            "jpText": "『はい……ありがとうございます。\nおべんきょう、がんばります』",
            "enText": "Okay… Thank you. I will study hard.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 211,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -9130983402142910016,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いウマ娘",
            "enName": "Young Horsegirl",
            "jpText": "『ぐすっ。あの子に負けちゃった……。\nパパ、ママ、ごめんなさい……』",
            "enText": "<i>Weeh</i>… I lost to that other girl… \nI'm sorry, papa… mama…",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 231,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 1068325003528477940,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いウマ娘の父親",
            "enName": "Young Horsegirl's Father",
            "jpText": "『なーに言ってるんだい！　最高にかっこよかったじゃないか！\nパパたちにとってはどんな順位でも関係ないさ！』",
            "enText": "Don't worry about that! You were really great out there! \nPapa and mama are proud of you no matter what place \nyou finish in!",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 249,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 2765299145474119488,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いアルヴ",
            "enName": "Young Arve",
            "jpText": "『……わたしの“パパ”とか“ママ”って、どこにいるんだろう？』",
            "enText": "…Where can I find my \"papa\" or \"mama\"?",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 191,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "pathId": 2985078143510073772,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いアルヴ",
            "enName": "Young Arve",
            "jpText": "『しせつのせんせいは、みんなかぞくだよっていってたけど……。\n“パパ”とか“ママ”じゃない……』",
            "enText": "The teachers say we're all one big family… but… \nthere's no \"papa\" or \"mama\"…",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 249,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "pathId": -8009783642304685911,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いアルヴ",
            "enName": "Young Arve",
            "jpText": "『――それって――さみしいこと？　かなしいこと？\n……よく、わからない。……わからないけど』",
            "enText": "…Is that something to feel sad about? Should I feel lonely? \nI don't really know… ",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 390,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "pathId": 351547253740804253,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いアルヴ",
            "enName": "Young Arve",
            "jpText": "『ときどき。こころの……まんなかのほうが、\nひゅうって、つめたくなるときがある』",
            "enText": "But I do know… that sometimes… it feels like something \nis pulling at my heart from the inside.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 253,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "pathId": -2636836357804448649,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いアルヴ",
            "enName": "Young Arve",
            "jpText": "『まるで、そこに。おおきなあなが、あいてるみたいに』",
            "enText": "As if there's a freezing hole growing larger there.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 184,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "pathId": -3968461162188388951,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いアルヴ",
            "enName": "Young Arve",
            "jpText": "『――でも』",
            "enText": "But…",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 31,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "pathId": -8217087463926791991,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イベント司会者",
            "enName": "Event Host",
            "jpText": "『URA協賛特別レースイベント・低学年の部！\n優勝はアドマイヤグルーヴさん！　前回に続き連覇です……！』",
            "enText": "The winner of this URA-sponsored special event's lower \nelementary division is Admire Groove! She does it again…!",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 284,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "pathId": -806260281243864546,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いアルヴ",
            "enName": "Young Arve",
            "jpText": "『……わたしは、だれにもまけてない。\nパパになでられてる子にも。ママにだきついてる子にも』",
            "enText": "…I haven't lost to anyone. Not to those kids praised by \ntheir daddies. Not to the ones hugging their mommies.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 358,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "pathId": 7784647075595709937,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いアルヴ",
            "enName": "Young Arve",
            "jpText": "『――そっか。だからだいじょうぶ、なんだ。\nわたし……だれにもまけないから――』",
            "enText": "…I see it now. It was so simple. \nIt's because I won't lose…",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 309,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "pathId": -4520727699379710199,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "幼いアルヴ",
            "enName": "Young Arve",
            "jpText": "『“パパ”も“ママ”も――きっとわたしには、いらないの』",
            "enText": "That's why I don't need this <i>papa</i> or <i>mama</i>.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 209,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 220,
                    "pathId": 7281573559512907903
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 220,
                    "pathId": 8633818536810198937
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4490750918807743038,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "両親同伴のウマ娘",
            "enName": "Horsegirl Accompanied by Parents",
            "jpText": "『えへへー♪　あたし、パパとママのために頑張るね！』",
            "enText": "Hehehee♪ I'll do my best for both of you!",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 150,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 220,
                    "pathId": 3501236381013362420
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 220,
                    "pathId": -4728690884752704270
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7134215408616446502,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "『……自分ひとり、強く在ればいい。\nそうすれば……穴は、自分で埋められるのだから』",
            "enText": "…I can just be strong on my own. It will all work out if I'm \njust strong enough… to close up that hole inside.",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 279,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 3899336574348492492
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 2769526315789593531
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 94,
                    "pathId": -4253793093039436270
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2270408641194878829,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（……私は勝ち続ける。\nトゥインクル・シリーズの第一線であろうと）",
            "enText": "(…I will keep on winning. Even in the heat of the Twinkle Series.)",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 234,
            "voiceIdx": 24,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 194,
                    "pathId": -3900805235041040546
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1934167472086006054,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（愛に包まれて……安穏と歩んできたような子たちになんて――\n絶対に負けない……！）",
            "enText": "(Those coddled by love… spending their days sheltered \nand carefree… They will never claim victory over me!)",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 270,
            "voiceIdx": 25,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 329,
                    "pathId": -8848419607715945858
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 112,
                    "pathId": 8499601437600753104
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4892135112136407773,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……ん？",
            "enText": "<i>…Hm?</i>",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 51,
            "voiceIdx": 26,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 74,
                    "pathId": 839256509759630973
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -1252530455603589563
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1658005899271641441,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（あれは――スティルインラブ……）",
            "enText": "(That's… Still in Love…)",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 107,
            "voiceIdx": 27,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 74,
                    "pathId": 4675630110269503723
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 75,
                    "pathId": 7564830520707060968
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5447316319232096753,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（多くの者が居ることにさえ気づかない、存在感の希薄な生徒。\nそれが、彼女……）",
            "enText": "(One of the other students. Someone with no presence \nto speak of, unremarked by most…)",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 256,
            "voiceIdx": 28,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": -7914693596441649544
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -59827109469706037
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -803919583464105770,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（けれど――彼女を見るたび、私は――\nっ……！）",
            "enText": "(To me, however… every time I see her, I…!)",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 225,
            "voiceIdx": 29,
            "pathId": 2916084568437735443,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アナウンサー",
            "enName": "Announcer",
            "jpText": "『1着は――――！\nアドマイヤグルーヴ、――――に続いてまたも敗れ……』",
            "enText": "<i>First place goes to —̵—̸—̴—̶! After defeat at the —̷—̴̶—̵, \nAdmire Groove has victory snatched from her again…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 245,
            "voiceIdx": 30,
            "pathId": -4091830239696831509,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "――最近、幾度も見る悪夢。\nそこで決まって私の前に立ちふさがるウマ娘――",
            "enText": "Lately, I keep having the same nightmare. \nIn it, the same horsegirl invariably thwarts me…",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 286,
            "voiceIdx": 31,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 328,
                    "pathId": 2518449335736126928
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 252157672576794262
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 328,
                    "pathId": 5594922659641222684
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1902298342973871691,
            "blockIdx": 32
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（――…………っ。いったい、彼女がなんだっていうの……？\nいい加減、おかしくなりそう）",
            "enText": "(……! Just what is it about her? \nI feel like I'm about to lose my mind.)",
            "nextBlock": 34,
            "origClipLength": 269,
            "voiceIdx": 32,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 290,
                    "pathId": 4748117767017400596
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 5123181807098081252
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 334,
                    "pathId": 8368566265086084308
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -3224736509223993276
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2330813673339324455,
            "blockIdx": 33
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "もう……うんざりだわ。\n悪夢の原因は……振り払わないと。",
            "enText": "I've… had enough. If she's the cause \nof these nightmares somehow…",
            "nextBlock": 35,
            "origClipLength": 279,
            "voiceIdx": 33,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -3851772034284720114
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -1942896773573099511
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 206,
                    "pathId": -943726725591732100
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7464817045509934793,
            "blockIdx": 34
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "――そう、併走よ。\n受けてくれるかしら？",
            "enText": "Yes, running together. Are you up for it?",
            "nextBlock": 36,
            "origClipLength": 160,
            "voiceIdx": 34,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 180,
                    "pathId": 349999144114696418
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 180,
                    "pathId": 6513662788061960012
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6222997835068793899,
            "blockIdx": 35
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スティルインラブ",
            "enName": "Still in Love",
            "jpText": "……そ、その……私などを、誘っていただけて……嬉しいです。\n本日は……精一杯、勉強させていただきます……。",
            "enText": "…A-Ah, I'm… honored… that you would invite someone like me. \nThank you… for allowing me this chance to learn from you. \nI will try to make the most of it…",
            "nextBlock": 37,
            "origClipLength": 423,
            "voiceIdx": 35,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 434,
                    "pathId": 1301743068129217826
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 272,
                    "pathId": -5177418146456779414
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -4729805104181690142
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3373299863864529263,
            "blockIdx": 36
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "ええ――どうぞ、よろしく。",
            "enText": "Yes, same here. Glad to have your company.",
